S modes, so this WG should communicate that.<u></u><u></u></p></div><div><d=
iv><p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u></u>=C2=A0<u></u></p></div><div><p class=3D"Ms=
oNormal">I&#39;m somewhere between=C2=A0supportive and ambivalent on the ff=
dhe* NamedGroup values in TLS 1.3. We do not expect to ever implement them =
in BoringSSL, and their performance would be quite a DoS concern if we ever=
 did. But that construction is not as deeply flawed as the TLS 1.2 construc=
tion.<u></u><u></u></p></div></div><p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u></u>=C2=A0<u><=
/u></p><div><div><p class=3D"MsoNormal">On Tue, Dec 13, 2022 at 9:46 AM Sea=
n Turner &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:sean@sn3rd.com" target=3D"_blank">sean@sn3rd=
